## Error Handling

The implementation handles:
- ❌ Key Vault key not found or disabled
- ❌ Missing Azure credentials
- ❌ Blob not found
- ❌ Storage access denied
- ❌ Corrupted ciphertext or wrong key
- ❌ Missing or invalid metadata
